## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Reason to fix first |
|----------|-------|--------|---------------------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | Low | Prevents false-pass; silent bug escape |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | Low | Hidden untested branch |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | Medium | 2 s wasted + flakiness on CI |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | Low | Blocks CI entirely (path doesn't exist) |
| 5 | Exception Handling | Low | One-line replacement with `Assert.ThrowsException` |
| 6 | Assertion Roulette | Low | Add message strings |
| 7 | Magic Number Test | Medium | Derive values from visible inputs |
| 8 | Sensitive Equality | Medium | Requires knowing the `Summary` type's properties |
| 9 | Eager Test | Medium | Decompose or mark as integration |
| 10 | General Fixture | Low | Delete unused field |

